    "title": "Portland Saying Goodbye to Fees for Pinball, Pool Tables - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Harding ,\n7 hours ago\nThe Willamette Week recently reported that, for the first time in 100 years, business owners in Portland, Oregon, will no longer need a special permit to operate a pinball machine or pool table. The policy is slated to sunset next month following the Oct. 14 passage of code changes proposed...\nRead full article",
